// t_36492ad8 commit 2.  Measured against sce-cgc 475.
// GAP ROW, card t_d60fbc59, NARROWED BY THIS SLICE.  A call in a default has
// two separate mechanisms and only ONE of them is still a gap:
//   HELPER parameter - substituted at the call site.  WORKS now; see
//                      fp_helper_default_call_f, which is a byte twin of
//                      writing the call out.
//   ENTRY uniform    - the reference records a defaultValue block, so the
//                      value must be CONSTANT-FOLDED.  We cannot evaluate a
//                      call and refuse rather than emit zero.
// This fixture is the entry form.  The card is now only about this half.
float g() { return 0.5; }
float4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0, uniform float k = g()) : COLOR { return t * k; }
